# Test Failure Triage

> **DRAFT** — sections marked `TODO` must be completed by the system-tests team.

Apply this rule when a user asks to triage a failing test (e.g. "triage this failure", "this test failed on the nightly, handle it").
The input is usually a test name, a CI job URL, or a Test Optimization link.

The procedure has four steps. **Never create a ticket or a PR without an explicit confirmation from the user** (see [Confirmation](#confirmation)).

## Key Documentation

- @.cursor/rules/test-activation.mdc: How to write the skip (manifest vs decorator)
- @docs/edit/manifest.md: Manifest format
- @docs/edit/skip-tests.md: Declarations and their behavior (`bug`, `flaky`, ...)
- @.github/CODEOWNERS: Owner team of a test file

