## Confirmation

After steps 1–2 analysis (and **before** creating anything), post a summary and wait for an explicit "go" from the user:

```
**Test:** tests/...::Class::method
**Scope:** <scenario> / <weblog(s)> / <library> <versions>
**Since:** <date> (last pass: <date>, <run url>)
**Recurrence:** <n> failures / <m> runs in the last <d> days
**Suspected cause:** <regression in library X.Y.Z | flaky | system-tests change | infra> (<confidence>)

**Proposed actions:**
1. JIRA: create in <PROJECT> | reuse <KEY>
2. Ping: <team / channel>
3. Skip: `<manifest entry or decorator>` in `<file>`
```

The user may amend any part. Only then create the ticket, prepare the skip, and post the ping.
